to an operator...</i>

1743
01:34:06.960 --> 01:34:08.041
<i>please stay on the line</i>

1744
01:34:08.160 --> 01:34:10.447
<i>and someone will be with you
as soon as possible.</i>

1745
01:34:17.680 --> 01:34:20.081
<b><font color="#408080">RECEPTIONIST 2:</font></b> Good
afternoon, MIT Mathematics,

1746
01:34:20.160 --> 01:34:21.321
<i>how may I direct your call?</i>

1747
01:34:22.680 --> 01:34:25.081
<i>Hello? I'm sorry.
I can't hear you very well.</i>

1748
01:34:25.240 --> 01:34:27.083
No! No.

1749
01:34:27.840 --> 01:34:29.808
<i>Yeah. There you are.</i>

1750
01:34:29.960 --> 01:34:31.246
<i>Yeah, can I help you?</i>

1751
01:34:31.400 --> 01:34:32.606
Uh, yes.

1752
01:34:35.280 --> 01:34:37.044
Doctor Shankland.

1753
01:34:37.560 --> 01:34:39.722
<i>I'm really sorry.
I can't hear you.</i>

1754
01:34:39.880 --> 01:34:41.723
<i>Could you speak up, please?</i>

1755
01:34:44.760 --> 01:34:45.807
<i>Hello?</i>

1756
01:34:49.680 --> 01:34:52.047
Evelyn Adler...

1757
01:34:52.200 --> 01:34:54.123
for Seymore Shankland, please.

1758
01:34:56.160 --> 01:34:57.416
<b><font color="#408080">PROFESSOR:</font></b>
And what I want you to notice,

1759
01:34:57.440 --> 01:34:58.885
is that when you
compute P of N...

1760
01:34:59.040 --> 01:35:00.963
for N congruent
to four mod five...

1761
01:35:01.120 --> 01:35:03.851
the answer
is a multiple of five.

1762
01:35:04.000 --> 01:35:05.889
So, the first person
to notice this

1763
01:35:05.960 --> 01:35:07.086
was Srinivasa Ramanujan.

1764
01:35:07.240 --> 01:35:08.810
In the beginning
of the 20th century...

1765
01:35:08.960 --> 01:35:11.327
he proved that
it was the case for all...

1766
01:35:11.480 --> 01:35:13.369
numbers congruent
to four mod five.

1767
01:35:13.560 --> 01:35:16.530
So, he proved
that P of five N plus four...

1768
01:35:16.680 --> 01:35:18.842
is congruent
to zero mod seven...

1769
01:35:19.000 --> 01:35:21.606
and that P of eleven N plus six

1770
01:35:21.680 --> 01:35:23.523
is congruent to zero mod eleven.

1771
01:35:23.600 --> 01:35:25.648
<b><font color="#808000">(INDISTINCT CHATTERING)</font></b>

1772
